# Jina auxiliary contract

- Jina v5 MLX is symmetric `text-matching` only: `task_type="text-matching"`, no query/document prompt.
- Use batch size `1` for MLX text-matching; do not trade symmetry for throughput.
- Jina vectors live in separate artifacts with full backend metadata.
- Reranker may only reorder a frozen Qwen top-50 pool; it cannot improve Recall@50.
- Instagram Jina chain-selection is archived; do not retry thresholds, modes, models, or rerankers for that objective.
- Pilot metrics and promotion status: `docs/architecture/experiment-ledger.md`.
